fix: require Node >=20.19.0 and harden CI and the integration test

- engines: >=20.19.0 (was >=20.18.1). e2b's CJS bundle require()s the ESM
  chalk package; require(ESM) is only on by default from Node 20.19.0, so
  20.18.1 crashed with ERR_REQUIRE_ESM at startup. Verified on 20.19.0,
  22.12.0 and 26.13.1.
- CI matrix now pins the floor explicitly: ['20.19.0', 22, 24].
- Integration test polls sandbox_list briefly: the control-plane list
  endpoint is eventually consistent (~500 ms observed), which made the
  previous single-shot assertion flaky.
- Document that behaviour in the sandbox_list tool description.